verses.text:
Comp. Minucius
Felix, Octav. xxi.; Arnobius, adv. Nat. v. 6, 7;
Augustine, Civ. Dei, vi. 7.

Touching these
gods of the vanquished nations, compare The Apology, xxv.;
below, c. xvii.; Minucius Felix, Octav. xxv.

It is not very clear
what is the force of “sed et pepererit,” as read by Oehler;
we have given the clause an impersonal turn.
